# UPSC Desk — Project Context

**Standalone repo:** `/Users/harshpratap/sites/upsc-desk` — NOT part of `dronacharya-fe` or any other project.

**Prior chat:** [UPSC Desk build](1ae4975e-47bb-43a3-86cf-2ab1cd17df67) (originally in dronacharya-fe workspace, moved to standalone repo Aug 19 2026)

## What this is

Personal UPSC CSE dashboard — private aggregator for Prelims + Mains across GS-1…GS-4. Aggregates current affairs from whitelisted gov.in, RBI, UN, environment, judiciary, and international sources. Links out to originals; does not republish content.

Reference UX inspiration: [UnderStand UPSC](https://www.understandupsc.com/) — pill tabs, daily archive, GS navigation — but this app is source-driven (live feeds), not coaching notes.

